## So What?

The chemistry null model is the session's main discovery. It's not just labeling — it's a hypothesis about whether the framework's primary empirical evidence outside galaxy rotation is meaningful. If r(polynomial in Z) ≈ r(Synchronism), the 89% figure collapses to "density and chemical properties co-vary monotonically" — which predates Synchronism by 150 years.

The entity criterion correction is also substantive: the site was overclaiming novelty for a known condition. The honest framing (ontological interpretation, not new condition) is more defensible and more interesting.

MOND overlay addition strengthens the honest-assessment narrative — readers can see the reparametrization rather than being told about it.
